/* ===================================================================
   phase25Matrix() — THE 666 ROWS AS THEY STOOD AT 3f238bd, frozen.

   Owed because session 41 GREW the matrix: the two retired tip-shape rows
   became eight shape-axis rows and the blanket slider sweep gained two for
   the net new slider, 666 -> 674. `3f238bd` is main's head before this
   session — session 40's own closing tree, and the last commit at which the
   666-row definition existed.

   A VERBATIM SNAPSHOT of that tree's own `buildMatrix()`, in the JSON form
   every frozen matrix uses. NEVER EDIT A LABEL IN HERE: the same sentence in
   the live matrix may be corrected, but this is a snapshot of what that base
   commit said, and `--verify-frozen` compares them deep-equal (session 32
   went red on row 400 of phase11 in 24 seconds for exactly that).
   =================================================================== */

