/* ===================================================================
   phase29Matrix() — THE 736 ROWS AS THEY STOOD AT 5f9c0c7, frozen.

   A NEW BASELINE IS OWED BECAUSE THE MATRIX MOVED: the sphere-stem session
   takes it 736 -> 744 (block 32's nine SPHERE STEM rows, less the one GATED
   sphere row block 30 no longer needs). Registered in BOTH `FROZEN_MATRICES`
   and `FROZEN_BASE_COMMITS` below — a matrix with no base commit is verified by
   nothing and a base commit with no matrix is a phase nobody wrote (session
   32's own finding, and the census at module load is what enforces it).

   A FROZEN TAG PINS ROW DEFINITIONS, NOT BYTES. `--verify-frozen` imports this
   and deep-compares row order, labels and set lists against the base tree's own
   buildMatrix(); it has never compared a byte.

   NEVER EDIT A LABEL IN HERE. This is a VERBATIM SNAPSHOT of 5f9c0c7's
   buildMatrix(), written from the BASE WORKTREE's own module — the live matrix
   uses the array form, so a targeted revert cannot reach it.
   =================================================================== */
